Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.51,0:01:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yay! Agora, vamos para a \Nnossa primeira carta da noite.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.87,0:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela é do pseudônimo Ayappe-san, \Nque mora no Distrito de Chuo.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.07,0:02:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hammer-san, Kamihama!"
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.85,0:02:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamihama!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.11,0:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hammer-san, você pode me dar um conselho?"
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Com todo o prazer!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.39,0:02:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Eu tenho 14 anos e estudo em Kamihama.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.01,0:02:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sempre participo de eventos sociais com alunos de outras escolas,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.65,0:02:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mas nunca me interessei por ninguém antes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.03,0:02:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Na verdade, eu me apaixonei por uma das minhas amigas, outra garota.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Esses eventos são legais, mas eu quero—"
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.80,0:02:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Parte de mim está faltando.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.81,0:02:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A forma do meu mundo mudou.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.37,0:02:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Além dos meus sonhos esquecidos...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.57,0:03:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}busco por rastros que desapareceram,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.32,0:03:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}e eu...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Até mais!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.38,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Até mais.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.77,0:03:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos recebendo uma nova \Naluna hoje, a Tamaki Iroha-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.35,0:03:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,É um prazer. Meu nome é Tamaki Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.89,0:04:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer almoçar conosco?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem...
