Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta página...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.51,0:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que o site já foi deletado.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é tudo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.67,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma pista que ainda te deixa sem pistas.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.18,0:16:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu queria te contar mesmo assim.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fico muito feliz.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.79,0:16:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Rena-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Spam de novo...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.66,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Apague!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho recebido muitos assim.
